\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503  quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7845\'3fp 1 (ch\u7911\'3f }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 u t}{\f283\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'fd}{
\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 ).
\par (b) Ch\u7911\'3f }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 u t}{\f283\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503  duy\u7879\'3ft d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n qu\'fd v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi B
\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh (V\u7909\'3f H\'e0nh ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp) }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7873\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503  ngh\u7883\'3f ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par (c) B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh (V\u7909\'3f H\'e0nh ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp) xem x\'e9t v\'e0 c\'f3 \'fd ki\u7871\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi Ban qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd d\u7921\'3f \'e1n v\'e0 ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f.
\par (1) Nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7891\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 ng v\'e0 }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7873\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 
 ngh\u7883\'3f thanh to\'e1n.
\par (2) Ban qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd d\u7921\'3f \'e1n, c}{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'e3}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n qu\'fd }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0}{
\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'e3 }{\f283\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 c B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, ph\'e1t h\'e0nh u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm chi cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0
ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f.
\par (3) Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f thanh to\'e1n cho nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu theo }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'f0\u7873\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503  ngh\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Ban qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd d\u7921\'3f \'e1n.

