\par (a) B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch cho T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc }{\f275\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 \'d0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid7238503\charrsid7238503 u t}{
